系统。只需插入光盘、U 盘或存储卡，启动 IsoBuster 并选择驱动器（若未自动选中），程序便会自动挂载介质。IsoBuster 能即时显示介质上的所有分区、轨道、会话信息，以及存在的全部文件系统。通过类似资源管理器的界面，您可以便捷访问每个文件系统中的所有文件和文件夹。不同于操作系统仅提供单一文件系统的访问权限，IsoBuster 让您掌握“完整视图”——可读取历史会话数据、隐藏分区内容，以及操作系统（如 Windows）不可见或刻意隐藏的数据信息。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.isobuster.com/news/isobuster_5.8_release_notes","tags":["cd","dvd","iso","恢复","数据","文件","还原","镜像"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://www.isobuster.com/","releaseDate":"2026-05-11","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.isobuster.com/news/isobuster_5.8_release_notes","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/s/SmartProjects/IsoBuster/5.8/SmartProjects.IsoBuster.yaml","sha256":"d205e00f4393e83683f2a0b29f453ffba21e79106fc447fe3a3c665ee8635dcd"},{"path":"manifests/s/SmartProjects/IsoBuster/5.8/SmartProjects.IsoBuster.installer.yaml","sha256":"5581397130f7f3afe68eb49ba42a462fd7bc6837c0e3106ad7377a6f59ddd174"},{"path":"manifests/s/SmartProjects/IsoBuster/5.8/SmartProjects.IsoBuster.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"e22cbf103d1abddc029795c74810d97f441d3b682dcec01d3b2d468390bc26ea"},{"path":"manifests/s/SmartProjects/IsoBuster/5.8/SmartProjects.IsoBuster.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"e59390ff53b089c5cdb4836fcfc679ff2b1e71c0098644dc156d381123341cda"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"5.8"}